        "text": "Base rate and reference class: I use the official monthly LNU0201B46B series since October 2022, emphasizing 2024-2026 because the series has settled into a post-pandemic plateau. The base rate is persistence around the recent 21.7-22.7 percent band rather than a trend extrapolation from the 2022-2024 rise."
