        "text": "Level and momentum: July 2026 printed 22.2 after 21.7 in June and 21.8 in May. The 2026 year-to-date average through July is about 22.24, but April-July average is about 21.85, so I center just below July at 22.1 rather than chasing the one-month rebound."
